    <string name="notice_agreement_body">[Isposed Manager User Agreement]\n\nThanks for using Isposed Manager. Read and accept the terms below before you continue.\n\n1. Nature of the software\n1. Isposed Manager is an open source rootless Android manager built on LSPosed (GPL-3.0) and AxManager (Apache-2.0).\n2. It gains system management capability through wireless debugging (rootless) or root access.\n\n2. Usage risks\n1. Changing system parameters, freezing apps and installing modules may affect device stability. You bear the risk.\n2. Back up your data before any operation. The author is not responsible for losses caused by this software.\n3. Some customized ROMs may be incompatible. Use it with care.\n\n3. Compliant use\n1. Do not use this software for illegal, improper or rights-infringing purposes.\n2. Follow local laws and the device vendor terms of service.\n\n4. Open source license\n1. This software is released under GPL-3.0, derived from LSPosed (GPL-3.0) and AxManager (Apache-2.0).\n2. See Settings > About > Third party open source statement for details.\n\n5. AI features\n1. Read the AI usage notice before using any AI feature.\n\n6. Disclaimer and updates\n1. This software updates from time to time. Updates are announced inside the app.\n2. Stop using and uninstall the app if you do not accept this agreement.\n\n— 万古沧海</string>
    <string name="notice_ai_body">[AI Usage Notice]\n\nThis software offers AI features (AI provider setup, module conversion, direct AI development). Read this before you continue:\n\n1. Data transmission\n1. AI features send your prompt and the module metadata you selected to the AI provider you configured.\n2. Keep private data, passwords and keys out of your prompts.\n3. The author never collects, stores or uploads your prompt content.\n\n2. Custom API\n1. AI features require a provider API compatible with OpenAI (base URL, API key and model).\n2. Your API key stays on this device and is never uploaded to a third party.\n\n3. Generated results\n1. Generated module code may contain defects. Review it before use.\n2. You bear the risk of the generated module and its behavior.\n\n4. Responsibility\n1. The author gives no warranty about the accuracy or safety of generated content.\n2. Using AI features means you have read and accepted this notice.\n\n— 万古沧海</string>
    <string name="notice_oss_body">[Open Source Statement]\n\nIsposed Manager is open source software released under GPL-3.0. The following projects were referenced during development, and this app declares and thanks them:\n\n1. LSPosed\n· Project: https://github.com/LSPosed/LSPosed\n· License: GPL-3.0\n· Used for: module management contracts (xposedmodule metadata), module enable and scope logic, LSPosed daemon communication bridge.\n· Basis: as a GPL-3.0 derivative, this app is released under GPL-3.0 and preserves the original copyright and license notices.\n\n2. AxManager (Axeron Manager)\n· Project: https://github.com/fahrez182/AxManager\n· License: Apache-2.0\n· Used for: rootless activation (mDNS discovery, TLS pairing and connection, TCP mode switching), the shell executor, plugin installation (module.prop + customize.sh) and Re-ignite restart.\n· Basis: Apache-2.0 permits derivative use, so this app preserves its copyright, license and credits (see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).\n\n3. This software\n· Author: 万古沧海 (GitHub: https://github.com/1953187487)\n· Copyright: Copyright (C) 2026 万古沧海\n· License: GPL-3.0 (see the LICENSE file)\n\nThe full upstream license texts are available in About > Third party open source statement.</string>

