    <string name="about_license_expand">View the open source license and copyright statement</string>
    <string name="about_license_text">This app is released under the GPL-3.0 license.\n\nFoundation framework LSPosed (GPL-3.0)\nLSPosed Framework is maintained by the LSPosed Contributors.\nThis app is developed on top of LSPosed and rewrites the whole module management layer.\nUpstream copyright notices and the GPL-3.0 license text are preserved.\n\nOriginal authors and upstream projects:\nLSPosed (GPL-3.0) - foundation hook framework\nAxManager / Axeron (Apache-2.0) - reference for wireless activation, shell and plugin install\n\nThe open source terms of the projects above are followed and their copyright notices are preserved.</string>

